      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `model_client.py` file, I need to write code that provides local configuration and client helper utilities for Hosted LLM Inference and Model-Family Selection. I will use the Amazon Bedrock service for this task, as it is a concrete third-party managed service that provides access to various foundation models, including large language models (LLMs). The code will import the necessary modules from the `bedrock` SDK, set up the client configuration, and provide helper functions for model inference and model-family selection. </thinking>\n",
