    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `stream_completion.py` that streams partial output tokens from a hosted LLM, I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which is a concrete external provider. I will include the necessary imports and authentication to identify the provider in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
